  <diagram id="jr_5Q4vdl6hdOs87OGcD" name="Level-1 DFD">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n\nleft to right direction\n\nskinparam shadowing false\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; EXTERNAL ENTITIES\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nrectangle \&quot;Farmer\&quot; as Farmer\nrectangle \&quot;FPO / Procurement Officer\&quot; as FPO\nrectangle \&quot;Quality Inspector\&quot; as QI\nrectangle \&quot;Logistics Officer\&quot; as LO\nrectangle \&quot;Warehouse Officer\&quot; as WO\nrectangle \&quot;Processor / SHG\&quot; as Processor\nrectangle \&quot;Finance Officer\&quot; as Finance\nrectangle \&quot;Consumer\&quot; as Consumer\nrectangle \&quot;Administrator\&quot; as Admin\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; PROCESSES\n&#39; =====================================================\n\ncircle \&quot;User Management\&quot; as UserManagement\ncircle \&quot;Procurement &amp; Lot Management\&quot; as ProcurementManagement\ncircle \&quot;Quality Verification &amp; Certification\&quot; as QualityManagement\ncircle \&quot;Agreement Management\&quot; as AgreementManagement\ncircle \&quot;Logistics Management\&quot; as LogisticsManagement\ncircle \&quot;Warehouse &amp; Inventory Management\&quot; as WarehouseManagement\ncircle \&quot;Processor / SHG Purchase\&quot; as ProcessorPurchase\ncircle \&quot;Payment Management\&quot; as PaymentManagement\ncircle \&quot;Marketplace Management\&quot; as MarketplaceManagement\ncircle \&quot;Order Management\&quot; as OrderManagement\ncircle \&quot;Notification\&quot; as Notification\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; DATA STORES\n&#39; =====================================================\n\ndatabase \&quot;D1\\nUser Database\&quot; as D1\ndatabase \&quot;D2\\nProcurement Lot Database\&quot; as D2\ndatabase \&quot;D3\\nInspection &amp; Certificate Database\&quot; as D3\ndatabase \&quot;D4\\nAgreement Database\&quot; as D4\ndatabase \&quot;D5\\nShipment &amp; Logistics Database\&quot; as D5\ndatabase \&quot;D6\\nWarehouse &amp; Inventory Database\&quot; as D6\ndatabase \&quot;D7\\nPayment Database\&quot; as D7\ndatabase \&quot;D8\\nMarketplace Database\&quot; as D8\ndatabase \&quot;D9\\nOrder Database\&quot; as D9\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; USER MANAGEMENT\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nFarmer --&gt; UserManagement : 1. Registration / Login\nFPO --&gt; UserManagement : 2. Login\nQI --&gt; UserManagement : 3. Login\nLO --&gt; UserManagement : 4. Login\nWO --&gt; UserManagement : 5. Login\nProcessor --&gt; UserManagement : 6. Registration / Login\nFinance --&gt; UserManagement : 7. Login\nConsumer --&gt; UserManagement : 8. Registration / Login\nAdmin --&gt; UserManagement : 9. Login\n\nUserManagement --&gt; D1 : 10. User data\nD1 --&gt; UserManagement : 11. User information\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; PROCUREMENT &amp; LOT MANAGEMENT\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nFarmer --&gt; ProcurementManagement : 12. Submit procurement lot\nFPO --&gt; ProcurementManagement : 13. Manage / review lot\n\nProcurementManagement --&gt; D2 : 14. Lot data\nD2 --&gt; ProcurementManagement : 15. Lot details / status\n\nProcurementManagement --&gt; QualityManagement : 16. Inspection request\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; QUALITY VERIFICATION &amp; CERTIFICATION\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nQI --&gt; QualityManagement : 17. Inspection results\n\nQualityManagement --&gt; D3 : 18. Inspection &amp; certificate data\nD3 --&gt; QualityManagement : 19. Inspection records\n\nQualityManagement --&gt; ProcurementManagement : 20. Quality status\nQualityManagement --&gt; FPO : 21. Certification result\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; AGREEMENT MANAGEMENT\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nFPO --&gt; AgreementManagement : 22. Create farmer agreement\nAgreementManagement --&gt; Farmer : 23. Agreement for acceptance\nFarmer --&gt; AgreementManagement : 24. Accept / Reject agreement\n\nFPO --&gt; AgreementManagement : 25. Propose processor agreement\nAgreementManagement --&gt; Processor : 26. Agreement terms\nProcessor --&gt; AgreementManagement : 27. Accept / Reject agreement\n\nAgreementManagement --&gt; D4 : 28. Agreement data\nD4 --&gt; AgreementManagement : 29. Agreement status\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; LOGISTICS MANAGEMENT\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nFPO --&gt; LogisticsManagement : 30. Shipment request\nLO --&gt; LogisticsManagement : 31. Schedule / assign vehicle\n\nLogisticsManagement --&gt; D5 : 32. Shipment data\nD5 --&gt; LogisticsManagement : 33. Shipment status\n\nLogisticsManagement --&gt; Farmer : 34. Pickup confirmation\nLogisticsManagement --&gt; WO : 35. Inbound delivery information\n\nLogisticsManagement --&gt; Processor : 36. Outbound delivery\nProcessor --&gt; LogisticsManagement : 37. Delivery confirmation\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; WAREHOUSE &amp; INVENTORY MANAGEMENT\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nWO --&gt; WarehouseManagement : 38. Receive shipment\nWarehouseManagement --&gt; D6 : 39. Receipt / batch / inventory data\nD6 --&gt; WarehouseManagement : 40. Inventory information\n\nWarehouseManagement --&gt; LogisticsManagement : 41. Stock dispatch confirmation\nLogisticsManagement --&gt; WarehouseManagement : 42. Stock dispatch request\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; PROCESSOR / SHG PURCHASE\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nProcessor --&gt; ProcessorPurchase : 43. Browse available lots\nProcessorPurchase --&gt; D2 : 44. Request lot information\nD2 --&gt; ProcessorPurchase : 45. Available lot data\n\nProcessor --&gt; ProcessorPurchase : 46. Submit purchase request\nProcessorPurchase --&gt; FPO : 47. Purchase request\n\nFPO --&gt; ProcessorPurchase : 48. Purchase decision\nProcessorPurchase --&gt; AgreementManagement : 49. Create purchase agreement\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; PAYMENT MANAGEMENT\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nProcessor --&gt; PaymentManagement : 50. Purchase payment\nFinance --&gt; PaymentManagement : 51. Verify / process payment\n\nPaymentManagement --&gt; D7 : 52. Payment transaction\nD7 --&gt; PaymentManagement : 53. Payment status\n\nPaymentManagement --&gt; FPO : 54. Payment confirmation\nPaymentManagement --&gt; Processor : 55. Payment status\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; MARKETPLACE MANAGEMENT\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nProcessor --&gt; MarketplaceManagement : 56. Create product listing\n\nMarketplaceManagement --&gt; D8 : 57. Product listing data\nD8 --&gt; MarketplaceManagement : 58. Product information\n\nConsumer --&gt; MarketplaceManagement : 59. Browse products\nMarketplaceManagement --&gt; Consumer : 60. Product information\n\n&#39; Processing is performed by Processor / SHG\n&#39; outside the ShreeAnna platform.\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; ORDER MANAGEMENT\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nConsumer --&gt; OrderManagement : 61. Place order\n\nOrderManagement --&gt; D9 : 62. Order data\nD9 --&gt; OrderManagement : 63. Order status\n\nOrderManagement --&gt; Consumer : 64. Order confirmation / status\nOrderManagement --&gt; Processor : 65. New order\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; NOTIFICATION\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nNotification --&gt; Farmer : 66. Notifications\nNotification --&gt; FPO : 67. Notifications\nNotification --&gt; QI : 68. Notifications\nNotification --&gt; LO : 69. Notifications\nNotification --&gt; WO : 70. Notifications\nNotification --&gt; Processor : 71. Notifications\nNotification --&gt; Finance : 72. Notifications\nNotification --&gt; Consumer : 73. Notifications\n\n&#39; =====================================================\n&#39; ADMINISTRATION\n&#39; =====================================================\n\nAdmin --&gt; UserManagement : 74. Manage users\nAdmin --&gt; ProcurementManagement : 75. Monitor procurement\nAdmin --&gt; QualityManagement : 76. Monitor quality\nAdmin --&gt; AgreementManagement : 77. Monitor agreements\nAdmin --&gt; LogisticsManagement : 78. Monitor logistics\nAdmin --&gt; WarehouseManagement : 79. Monitor warehouse\nAdmin --&gt; PaymentManagement : 80. Monitor payments\nAdmin --&gt; MarketplaceManagement : 81. Monitor marketplace\nAdmin --&gt; OrderManagement : 82. Monitor orders\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="pz1CAvmGqrhZh0oQEaJ8-2">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
